Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:12:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(stats_api): isolate timeout queries from average
 latency calculation

- Exclude timeout request latencies from totalLatencyUs to prevent skewing average latency
- Add timeoutQueries and latencyQueries atomic counters
- Expose timeout_queries and timeout_percentage in /api/v1/stats API
- Persist timeout and latency query counters in stats dump with backward compatibility
- Add unit test verifying latency calculation purity under timeout conditions
